# Normalize every text file to LF, in the repository and in every working tree.
#
# The committed build artifacts must be byte-reproducible: a build embeds the
# source it read (sourcemap `sourcesContent`), so a CRLF working tree on one
# platform and an LF one on another produce maps that differ. CI rebuilds and
# compares `dist/` against the committed copy, which only works when every
# checkout has the same line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets keep their bytes untouched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
